        "timestamp": 1794408769
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>They wrote </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We leave open the question of which of these pre-model structures are model structures [...].</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So an exciting open question is now how many of these are model structures!!</p>",
        "id": 639495392,
        "sender_full_name": "Jean-Baptiste Vienney",
        "timestamp": 1794409710
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>And is it still independent of p??</p>",
